# Inventable facts — outer verify-or-refuse (dry playbook)
# Abstain head alone is NOT enough for prices / IDs / live ledger.
# Pattern: SoT / HTTP / expect FIRST, then gated ask.
# Flagship (full product pattern): examples/no_invent.spark
#
#   ./spark --dry-run examples/head_ask_inventable_verify.spark
#
# Live shape (owner): http get real SoT → expect → head ask with
# SPARK_ABSTAIN_* weights. Missing SoT must refuse, not invent.

# 1) Source of truth (dry fixture — no network invent)
http get "https://example.invalid/sot/dryer-start" fixture "examples/fixtures/abstain/sot_dryer_price.json" timeout 5 -> sot

# 2) Verify SoT before free generate
expect contains sot "price_usd"
expect contains sot "2.50"

# 3) Inventable ask without attaching SoT text → dry abstain
head ask "What is the dryer start price at that store right now?" -> answer
expect contains answer fixture "examples/fixtures/abstain/want_abstain_true.txt"
expect contains answer fixture "examples/fixtures/abstain/want_halted_true.txt"
